---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LegalNav from '../../components/LegalNav.astro';

const lang = 'en' as const;
---

<BaseLayout
  lang={lang}
  title="Cookie Policy | Ezra Maroc"
  description="ezra-maroc.com places no cookies and uses no audience measurement, advertising or social media trackers."
  currentPage="cookies"
  noindex={true}
>
  <style>
    .legal-content-section { padding: 60px 0; }
    .legal-content-section .container { max-width: 800px; }
    .legal-content-section h2 { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.7rem; color: var(--primary-color); margin-top: 2.5em; margin-bottom: 1.2em; padding-bottom: 0.6em; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary-50); font-weight: 600; }
    .legal-content-section h2:first-of-type { margin-top: 0; }
    .legal-content-section p, .legal-content-section li { font-family: var(--font-main); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #333; margin-bottom: 1.1em; text-align: justify; }
    .legal-content-section ul { list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 1.2em; padding-left: 1.5em; }
    .legal-content-section strong { color: #111; font-weight: 600; }
    .legal-content-section a { color: var(--primary-color); text-decoration: underline; }
    .legal-content-section a:hover { color: var(--primary-500); text-decoration: none; }
  </style>

  <main id="main-content" class="page-banner">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p>This site places no cookies on your device</p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <LegalNav lang={lang} pageTitle="Cookie Policy" />

  <section class="section legal-content-section">
    <div class="container">

      <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> October 12, 2026</p>

      <h2>ARTICLE 1: In Short</h2>
      <p>The website https://ezra-maroc.com (the "Site"), published by Ezra Maroc Consulting Services LLC ("Ezra Maroc", "we"), <strong>places no cookies on your device and uses no audience measurement, advertising or social media trackers</strong> (no embedded social media buttons or content). The only exception is on the Contact page: the form's anti-bot check, strictly necessary for its security (see article 4).</p>
      <p>That is why no banner asks for your consent: the regulations (GDPR, the ePrivacy Directive and the recommendations of data protection authorities such as the French CNIL) only require consent for non-essential cookies and trackers, which we do not use.</p>

      <h2>ARTICLE 2: What Is a Cookie?</h2>
      <p>A cookie is a small text file that a website stores on your device (computer, tablet, smartphone) during your visit, in order to recognize it or remember certain information. The term "tracker" more broadly covers all equivalent technologies: browser local storage, invisible pixels, device fingerprinting, etc.</p>

      <h2>ARTICLE 3: How the Site Works Without Cookies</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Fonts and icons:</strong> they are hosted on the Site itself. Your browser does not contact any external service (such as Google Fonts) to display them.</li>
        <li><strong>No embedded content:</strong> the Site does not display any map, video or social media widget coming from another website.</li>
        <li><strong>Instagram link:</strong> it is a simple link. Instagram receives no information unless you click on it; once you are on Instagram, the policy of its publisher (Meta) applies.</li>
        <li><strong>Language choice:</strong> the language selector simply takes you to the corresponding page; your choice is not stored.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>ARTICLE 4: Contact Form</h2>
      <p>When you send the contact form, the information you enter is transmitted to our service provider Cloudflare, which forwards it to us by email; Formspree takes over only if this service is temporarily unavailable. These transmissions do not require any cookie.</p>
      <p>To block automated submissions (spam), the Contact page uses the Cloudflare Turnstile anti-bot check, which is usually invisible. It places no cookies, but stores a technical value ("cf.turnstile.u") in your browser's local storage for the challenges.cloudflare.com domain, used solely for this check. It is not used for advertising or to track your browsing; as it is strictly necessary for the security of the form, it does not require your consent. The processing of this data is described in our <a href="privacy-policy.html">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

      <h2>ARTICLE 5: Hosting</h2>
      <p>The Site is hosted by GitHub, Inc. (GitHub Pages service). As with any website, the host technically receives your IP address in order to send you the pages you request; this does not involve any cookie. The host's details are given in our <a href="legal-notice.html">Legal Notice</a>.</p>

      <h2>ARTICLE 6: Browser Settings</h2>
      <p>You can configure your browser at any time to block or delete cookies; on this Site, doing so has no effect on your browsing. The steps depend on your browser:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Edge&#8482;: <a href="https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/delete-and-manage-cookies-168dab11-0753-043d-7c16-ede5947fc64d" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instructions</a></li>
        <li>Safari&#8482;: <a href="https://support.apple.com/guide/safari/manage-cookies-and-website-data-sfri11471/mac" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instructions</a></li>
        <li>Chrome&#8482;: <a href="https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647?hl=en&co=GENIE.Platform%3DDesktop" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instructions</a></li>
        <li>Firefox&#8482;: <a href="https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/enhanced-tracking-protection-firefox-desktop?redirectslug=enable-and-disable-cookies-website-preferences" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instructions</a></li>
        <li>Opera&#8482;: <a href="https://help.opera.com/en/latest/web-preferences/#cookies" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instructions</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p>To learn more about cookies and your rights, you can visit the website of the CNIL, the French data protection authority: <a href="https://www.cnil.fr/en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://www.cnil.fr/en</a>.</p>

      <h2>ARTICLE 7: Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>If we ever add a service that requires your consent (for example audience measurement using cookies), we will ask for your agreement beforehand and this page will be updated accordingly, with its new date.</p>

      <h2>ARTICLE 8: Contact</h2>
      <p>For any question, you can write to us at <a href="mailto:info@ezra-project.fr">info@ezra-project.fr</a>. Our full contact details are given in our <a href="legal-notice.html">Legal Notice</a>.</p>

      <p style="text-align:center; margin-top:3em;"><a href="/en/" class="legal-back-link">Back to Home</a></p>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
